    "body": "Not sure if this is the best place to ask, but: Is the `anonymous` attribute expected to work for `srcdoc` iframes? I notice that it doesn't work in the Chrome dev trial. Wondering if this feature could be relevant to [this issue](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7328) - would be very useful for my purposes.\r\n\r\n([potentially relevant crbug](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=510122), as pointed out in the above issue)",
